      "issues": [
        "- The complementary pair example \"Some A are B\" + \"Some A are not B\" is not a valid either–or pair (they are subcontraries, not contradictories) → Valid complementary pairs are \"All A are B\" with \"Some A are not B\" and \"No A is B\" with \"Some A are B\""
